==German==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|de|Türke|gloss1=Turk|-n-|Taube|gloss3=pigeon}}. So named because the species expanded its habitat from what is now western Turkey towards the north-west over the course of the 20th century, first reaching German-speaking areas around 1940.

